      stimulus: "Dalia runs a café. The café trade association publishes average ratios for its members, most of which are city-centre cafés that are part of chains. Dalia's café is in a small town. For the year ended 31 December 2026 Dalia's figures were: revenue $146,000, all for cash; opening inventory $3,500; purchases (all on credit) $59,400; closing inventory $4,500; expenses $65,700; trade payables at 31 December 2026 $6,500. The trade association averages for 2026 were: gross margin 65%; profit margin 12%; rate of inventory turnover 20 times; trade payables turnover 30 days. Dalia has no loans and no trade receivables.",
