          points: ["Cost of sales $58,400 and gross profit $87,600 (1)", "Gross margin 60.00% (1)", "Profit margin 15.00% (1)", "Average inventory $4,000 (1)", "Rate of inventory turnover 14.60 times (1)", "Trade payables turnover 39.94 or 40 days (1)"],
