          points: ["Gross margin worse, with reason such as lower prices or no bulk discounts (1)", "Profit margin better, with reason such as lower rent and wages (1)", "Expenses as a share of revenue compared, about 45% against 53% (1)", "Inventory turnover worse, with reason and the risk of waste (1)", "Payables longer than average (1)", "Payables: advantage for cash but risk to discounts or goodwill (1)"],
