          points: ["Average reflects city-centre chains with different scale, prices and rents (1)", "Consequence: differences arise from type and location, not management (1)", "Average members may use different accounting policies or definitions (1)", "Consequence: figures not on the same basis; average may also be dated or hide a wide range (1)"],
